cards.content:
Pasangan primitif dan wrapper-nya:

| Primitif | Wrapper |
|---|---|
| `int` | `Integer` |
| `double` | `Double` |
| `boolean` | `Boolean` |
| `char` | `Character` |
| `long` | `Long` |

Memasukkan ke kardus disebut **autoboxing**, membukanya disebut **unboxing**. Keduanya terjadi otomatis:

```java
Integer x = 5;     // autoboxing: int → Integer
int y = x;         // unboxing: Integer → int
```

```java run
import java.util.ArrayList;
import java.util.List;

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        List<Double> harga = new ArrayList<>();
        harga.add(2500.0);
        harga.add(4000.0);
        double total = harga.get(0) + harga.get(1);
        System.out.println(total);
    }
}
```

